# The shell scripts and flow files here are executed by Linux CI runners, where a
# stray CR breaks `set -o pipefail` and any argument at end of line. The repo is
# already LF-clean via each contributor's core.autocrlf, but that is local config;
# pinning it here makes the guarantee a property of the repo instead.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
